          "description": "Little Symphony’s music is designed for little listeners to connect with nature around the world. Matterhorn captures the serenity of Switzerland’s iconic mountain peak, blending warm guitar melodies with gentle birdsong recorded from the Alps. This calming instrumental soundscape creates a peaceful atmosphere for rest, focus, and relaxation, ideal for bedtime and unwinding after a busy day. Its soothing ambience helps little ones ease big emotions and drift into peaceful sleep. The tranquility of the mountains can also enhance mindfulness or wellness routines, support playtime focus, or set a comforting tone for restful evenings.",
